REQP-1577#1 Warning
Clock output buffering  
MMCME2_ADV connectivity violation. The signal rx_i/ZmodSDRController/U0/InstDataPath/FboutDcoClk on the rx_i/ZmodSDRController/U0/InstDataPath/InstMMCM_SDR/CLKFBOUT pin of rx_i/ZmodSDRController/U0/InstDataPath/InstMMCM_SDR does not drive the same kind of BUFFER load as the other CLKOUT pins. Routing from the different buffer types will not be phase aligned and therefore zero hold time at the IO flip-flop(s) may not be met.
Related violations: <none>

